WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:03.530
<i>Deep in the inner palace,</i>

00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:06.590
<i>there lives a consort 
known as the Raven Consort.</i>

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:11.890
<i>She holds a special position. 
Despite her title of consort,</i>

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:14.240
<i>she does not perform nighttime duties.</i>

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:16.920
<i>Though she lives in the inner palace,</i>

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:20.490
<i>she has no contact with the emperor.</i>

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:24.960
<i>It is said that she can use 
mysterious arts...</i>

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.960
You're just a bird. 
What are you so worried about?

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:33.370
Oh, it's a skylark.

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:37.090
Songbirds make everything feel 
so nice and colorful when they sing.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:39.470
I'm sure it would, were it still alive.

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:40.100
What?

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:43.920
It vanished.

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:46.520
It was the ghost of a skylark.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:49.230
Apparently, it failed to 
cross over to the other side.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:53.310
Then perhaps that was 
the Skylark Princess's bird.

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:54.490
The Skylark Princess?

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:57.740
There was a princess known by that name.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:01.180
She apparently kept a skylark 
that was rather fond of her.

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.670
Where is she now?

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:09.340
She's dead. She slipped and fell in a lake.

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:11.140
Poor thing.

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:13.880
It must still be wandering this world,

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:16.970
unable to return to its princess.

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:21.760
Your Highness, would it be possible for you 
to send that skylark to paradise?

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:23.930
It's likely possible.

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:26.380
Please help it, then!

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:28.550
It's too pitiful to leave 
in its current state.

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:32.180
Oh, right. Making a request 
requires payment.

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:33.360
What should I offer?

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:36.110
I do not require payment 
to save a single bird.

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:37.490
Really?

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:40.990
Tell me what you know.

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:56.120
<i>I shall play the best role of all</i>

00:01:56.120 --> 00:02:02.790
<i>The saddest role where one kills the most</i>

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:09.880
<i>Even at the ends of this square ocean, 
people change and are replaced</i>

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:15.870
<i>You forget that you're 
playing a role in this world</i>

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:19.240
<i>Everyone is just a bird in a cage</i>

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:22.920
<i>We all look forward to the day we can escape</i>

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:26.130
<i>And once it's within our grasp</i>

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:29.270
<i>The great big sky overwhelms us</i>

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:33.790
<i>MYSTERIOUS</i>

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:39.830
<i>Call out the name and bring calm</i>

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:49.830
<i>No one can stop your MYSTERIOUS</i>

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:58.260
<i>My MYSTERIOUS</i>

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:08.930
<i>Now, I shall play the best role of all</i>

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:10.960
Raven of the Inner Palace

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:15.210
Canglang Hall

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:18.560
Your Highness, allow me to join you.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:20.260
Why did you follow me?

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:24.510
The emperor's attendant 
instructed me to protect you.

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:31.100
<b>Episode 4 
The Skylark Princess</b>

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:29.230
This is the palace where 
the princess once lived.

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:31.550
But why did you want to come here?

00:03:31.550 --> 00:03:35.480
If that princess's pet skylark is a ghost,

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:38.140
then it must still feel some 
attachment to this world.

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:41.360
I must remove the cause if 
I'm to send it off to paradise.

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:46.250
It would seem she was treated rather coldly.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:48.510
Her mother was a court lady.

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:52.000
She apparently didn't have 
enough to eat at times.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.560
What is it?

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:57.560
Nothing.

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:02.010
This must the lake where the princess died.

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:04.620
I don't sense any ghosts here.

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:07.310
The princess seems to have 
moved on without issue.

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:09.920
Raven Consort, look at this.

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:14.260
Did someone leave these here?

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:18.420
Probably. It would seem there's someone 
who was close with the princess.

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:21.810
I'm going to go ask around.

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:23.410
You stay here.

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:24.410
Yes, Your Highness.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.080
She said what?

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:27.280
Pohe Palace

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:27.280
Unbelievable!

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:28.270
Right?

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:28.970
You there.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:30.740
Oh! You scared me...

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:33.160
I'd like to ask you about something.

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:34.720
Who are you?

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:36.000
I'm from the Ye Ming Palace.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:39.670
The Ye Ming Palace? As in 
the Raven Consort's palace?

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:42.630
I have questions about the Skylark Princess.

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:46.040
Is there anyone here who was close with her?

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:47.580
The Skylark Princess?

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:50.620
That was so long ago.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:52.810
All we know are rumors.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:59.580
But I believe I heard the late Crane Consort 
sometimes delivered food to her.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:01.140
The late Crane Consort?

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:04.570
Would that be Xie Fei, the mother 
of the current emperor?

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:07.450
Oh, I've heard that, too!

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:10.580
The woman who used to serve
 her might know something.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.500
What's her name? Where is she now?

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:16.300
She's a lady-in-waiting for
 the current Crane Consort.

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:18.430
Her name is Yang Shiniang.

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:20.940
Yang Shiniang. You've been very helpful.

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:23.930
If you mean to go meet her, 
you cannot right now.

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:27.430
The Crane Consort is in the 
middle of selecting fabrics.

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.870
It's a very big job.

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:32.100
It'll probably take all day.

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:34.150
Merely selecting fabrics?

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:37.410
It's merely selecting fabrics, 
but it's not <i>just</i> selecting fabrics.

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:41.480
Sometimes the fabrics she doesn't choose 
are given to her ladies-in-waiting.

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:43.900
After all, the Crane Consort 
is a generous person.

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.650
Having some kind of backing goes a long way.

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:49.740
If only we were ladies-in-waiting, too.

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:53.200
Does every palace normally do that?

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.030
Some don't.

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:57.210
You're out of luck if yours doesn't.

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:58.690
Out of luck...

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:03.020
Is that how it works?

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:06.470
I've never given her anything like that.

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:11.350
I said I'd join you whenever you go out.

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:14.430
It's not necessary for you 
to always accompany me.

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:17.180
Even though you took Wen Ying with you?

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:19.850
He simply chose to follow me.

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:23.730
What is a lady-in-waiting meant to do 
if not accompany her consort?

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:26.110
Are you saying you don't need me?

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:28.060
That's not what I meant.

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:32.290
In any case, let me know next time.

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:41.230
Jiu-Jiu, this is for you.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:43.860
What? Why all of a sudden?

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:50.790
Didn't His Majesty give this to you?

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:52.780
I can't accept this.

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:56.430
You don't like it? Would you 
prefer clothes instead?

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:59.110
I don't want anything from you.

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:01.550
But isn't it better to receive
 some kind of gift?

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:05.040
Do I seem that greedy to you?

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:07.070
No, it's not that...

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:11.660
I thought I was doing my best 
to faithfully serve you,

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:13.570
but this...

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.240
How could you?!

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:18.750
Why is she upset?

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:23.130
The Raven Consort tried to give 
you hairpins from His Majesty?

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:23.130
Eunuch 
Yi Siha

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:26.970
That's right. As though I could 
accept something like that!

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:29.800
The Raven Consort doesn't seem 
to realize she's a noble.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.130
She dresses herself,

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:34.890
and she wanders off as soon
 as I take my eyes off her.

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:38.030
Are you listening, Yi Siha?

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:42.210
You must really like the Lady Consort.

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:42.900
What?

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:47.240
Every time you come here, 
she's all you talk about.

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:51.990
Well, that's because... I can't complain 
about her in the inner palace, is all!

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:57.240
Huh. I thought you two were close,

00:07:57.640 --> 00:07:59.950
but I guess things are complicated.

00:08:05.390 --> 00:08:08.550
Why am I trying to please Jiu-Jiu?

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:17.690
Perhaps I shouldn't keep 
people here, after all.

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:21.590
I should send Jiu-Jiu back to 
the palace she was serving before.

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:25.140
I'm sure that would be better for her, too.

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.790
What's this scrap of wood?

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:41.720
Why are you here?

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:44.180
I told you not to come here anymore.

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:47.650
You sound dispirited. Did something happen?

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:48.670
Silence.

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:51.730
Is this a fat lizard?

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:53.550
No, it's a bird.

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:55.720
Is it a gift for someone?

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:59.050
No. It's none of your business.

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:02.000
What kind of bird were you 
intending to carve?

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.800
I haven't decided yet.

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:08.060
I simply wished to create a bird 
capable of flying across the sea.

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.850
It should be a cave swallow, then.

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:12.440
They're strong fliers.

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:20.580
That's nice work. 
You really are good at that.

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.330
I'm not finished yet.

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:26.590
Someone taught me how to
 carve when I was little.

00:09:26.590 --> 00:09:28.170
His name was Ding Lan.

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:32.420
He was close in age to my father, 
but he was my friend.

00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:33.890
Ding Lan?

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:37.680
You mustn't mention his name 
in His Majesty's presence.

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:41.140
So, what do you want?

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:44.170
Surely you didn't come here to carve a bird.

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:48.900
I thought I'd give these to you.

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:54.400
Paper-bubble candy.

00:09:55.270 --> 00:09:57.220
I'm glad you seem pleased.

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:59.000
I'm <i>not</i> pleased.

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:01.580
What is it?

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:05.190
I'd like to ask for your 
opinion on something.

00:10:06.090 --> 00:10:09.580
Do you ever give things to Wei Qing?

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:13.090
Things? I've given him a sword.

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:14.950
Did it make him angry?

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:19.220
I think he was happy about it. Right?

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:22.470
Yes, Master. I'll treasure it for life.

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.000
I see.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:26.730
What happened? Tell me about it.

00:10:33.620 --> 00:10:34.980
I see.

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:36.860
She became upset,

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:40.140
but you don't know why.

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:47.230
Not all ladies-in-waiting work for gifts.

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:51.310
It probably offended her 
that you thought she did.

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:55.250
Is that so? Then she should have said so.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:58.400
There is much you don't know about the world.

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:03.140
You shouldn't take what little you've heard 
at face value and do such silly things.

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:06.850
Besides, you don't understand the 
subtleties of the people closest to you.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:09.230
At this rate, you'll only 
upset someone again.

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:13.650
Are <i>you</i> mad at me? Why?

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:17.400
Who gives a gift they've 
received to someone else?

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:19.610
You said I could throw it away.

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:21.760
I never said you could give it 
to someone else.

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:23.280
Don't split hairs.

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:26.370
Shouxue, what happened to the amber fish?

00:11:27.150 --> 00:11:29.090
I put it away.

00:11:29.090 --> 00:11:32.420
I see. Whatever you do, 
don't give that away.

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:34.670
Ding Lan made that.

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:37.050
It's a symbol

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:40.650
of my promise not to kill you.

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:43.530
Hold onto it.

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:46.230
Why did you give me 
something so important to you?

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:47.310
I don't know.

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:52.600
I'll finish this by my next visit.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:57.340
And if you feel like giving your 
lady-in-waiting a gift, give her food.

00:11:57.730 --> 00:12:01.660
That won't upset her, 
just as you're not upset now.

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:03.730
I'll be back.

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:10.250
Xiangniao Temple

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:13.050
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:12:13.050 --> 00:12:16.380
I am Xue Yuyong of the Ministry of Works.

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:16.380
Ministry of Works 
Xue Yuyong

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:19.850
I heard you had fallen ill. 
Have you recovered?

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:23.170
I seem to be feeling much 
better the past few days.

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:25.640
How can I help you?

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:32.900
I'm not sure how to help you with that.

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:36.660
You're a priest of the goddess Niao Lian.

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:38.520
You must know about the Raven Consort.

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:43.530
As I said, I do not know anything 
about the Raven Consort.

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:46.910
I heard the Raven Consort was
 a priestess of Niao Lian.

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:49.470
Gods and priestesses
are two different things.

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:53.150
The Raven Consort is outside my expertise.

00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:55.680
Then have you ever heard this phrase?

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:59.170
"The Raven Consort could have 
everything if she so desired."

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:03.670
What does it mean that the Raven Consort 
and emperor are like oil and water?

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:06.830
Are there perhaps secrets 
even I am unaware of?

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:12.800
You should ask the Raven Consort 
about matters concerning her.

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:15.040
Now that you mention it,

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:19.510
they say the Raven Consort can 
drive off miasmas that prevent sleep.

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:22.890
Why don't you ask her to do that for you?

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:28.570
You look pale, Your Majesty.

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:30.330
Canglang Hall

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:33.330
Are you making an offering of flowers?

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:35.730
I am the Raven Consort.

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:39.250
Shiniang, I've been waiting for you.

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:40.560
Lady-in-waiting 
Yang Shiniang

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:40.560
For me?

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:43.740
Are you ill?

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:49.230
No, I simply develop a cough 
when the seasons change.

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:50.690
You wish to speak with me?

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:51.640
Yes.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.250
It's the ghost of a skylark.

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:58.310
Do you recognize it?

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:02.540
Yes. After all, it was rather
 fond of the princess.

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:04.690
I'd like to send it off to paradise.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:08.200
To that end, I'd like you to
 tell me about the princess.

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:11.320
You were close, were you not?

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:17.280
I allowed her to die all alone.

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:25.420
She was sickly and was sometimes bedridden.

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:28.970
But she was not given any medicines.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:33.740
Requesting them from the court physician 
required the empress dowager's permission.

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:39.330
When she felt well, she grew vegetables 
and flowers in the garden.

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:43.440
I occasionally helped her.

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:47.600
The princess was kind to me.

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:54.670
When I'd just entered the inner palace and 
was missing my family, she consoled me.

00:14:55.640 --> 00:15:01.910
But despite being a court lady, 
I got into an argument with the princess.

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:06.790
Something happened the day after.

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:11.430
The skylark came and chirped at me 
as though it wanted something.

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:13.790
I had a bad feeling about it.

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:17.490
But because of the events 
of the previous day,

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:19.750
I was too ashamed to face the princess.

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:22.750
Before I knew it, the skylark was gone.

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:26.740
And the princess was found here...

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:30.910
Every day, I think about how things 
might have been different

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:32.580
if I'd listened to that skylark.

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:37.260
If she was sickly, then the cold waters 
of this lake must have been fatal to her.

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:39.610
It would have been difficult to save her.

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:45.050
Still, I wish I could have at least 
held her hand before she died.

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:47.930
I wish I could have told her 
I was there for her.

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:52.760
I'm sorry for making you talk 
about such painful memories.

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:55.600
You should request an infusion 
of fritillaria bulbs from a doctor.

00:15:56.730 --> 00:16:00.480
Raven Consort, please help that skylark.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:04.600
I can't help but think of it 
as the Skylark Princess herself.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:14.740
I heard you've been looking 
into the Skylark Princess.

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:18.010
You always show up no matter 
where I go, don't you?

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.270
Where did these come from?

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:25.250
A lady-in-waiting who had dealings 
with the princess left them for her.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:29.380
I see. So she has people to 
leave flowers on her grave.

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:34.530
They're sweetbriar. The princess herself 
apparently grew them in the garden.

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:37.270
She must have liked those flowers.

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:39.300
That may not be all.

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:44.320
The princess also grew 
honeysuckle and chrysanthemums.

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:47.120
They're all ingredients for medicines.

00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:50.910
The princess was probably 
growing medicinal flowers herself

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:52.900
and drinking infusions made from them.

00:16:54.060 --> 00:16:56.410
She had some knowledge of medicines.

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:57.780
And...

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:03.020
I believe it's also the reason 
she fell into the lake.

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:04.800
Those are fritillaria.

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:06.710
They're used to make a cough suppressant.

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:10.890
I see. So she slipped while 
trying to harvest those,

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:13.940
though there was no reason for
 her to force herself to do so.

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:16.540
No, she had to.

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:21.450
Most likely, she did it for that girl who 
coughs at the change of the seasons.

00:17:22.550 --> 00:17:25.620
By the way, what happened 
to your bird carving?

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:27.350
The cave swallow?

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:28.860
It's done.

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:31.360
It's well-made.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:46.080
Go on.

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:50.210
Now, follow that bird.

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:52.130
Tell the princess

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:55.260
that Shiniang still cares for her.

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:00.060
That should do it.

00:18:00.060 --> 00:18:03.030
That swallow will lead 
the skylark to paradise.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:06.120
So that's why you needed a strong flier.

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:08.850
It's a good thing I made it.

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:10.060
Quiet, you.

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:14.320
However, I do appreciate 
that you made a good bird.

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:17.280
Thank you.

00:18:20.180 --> 00:18:21.110
What is it?

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:23.120
That was novel.

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:29.780
It was delightful, as though a stubbornly 
aloof cat finally showed me some affection.

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:34.420
I don't have a shred of affection for you!

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:37.670
Wait. I'm here because 
I wanted to talk to you.

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:40.030
Have you reconciled with Jiu-Jiu?

00:18:40.030 --> 00:18:42.060
We have no need to reconcile.

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:43.860
You shouldn't push her away.

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:45.180
It will only disappoint you.

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:47.600
I'm not pushing her...

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:52.300
What is this bird?

00:18:52.300 --> 00:18:55.110
A willow tit. It's like you.

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:56.230
Because it's small?

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:59.240
Small and sweet.

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:07.030
The man who taught me to make these 
was a cheerful and amicable man.

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:09.460
I loved Ding Lan.

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:14.010
That day, he went out 
to get some hollyhock.

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:18.970
I told him it wasn't necessary, 
but I liked pickled hollyhock.

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:22.670
That was the last time I saw him alive.

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:28.520
The empress dowager knew exactly 
how much I depended on Ding Lan.

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:32.520
So she tortured him to death.

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:35.290
His corpse was like a tattered rag.

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:40.990
I'm sure you have some reason 
to turn people away.

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:43.740
But you should reconcile with her.

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:45.990
It'll be too late once she's gone.

00:19:57.530 --> 00:19:59.610
I sent off that skylark.

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:01.730
Th-Thank you.

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:10.020
Jiu-Jiu, I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:13.650
I'd heard consorts give gifts 
to their ladies-in-waiting.

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:17.900
I simply thought I ought to 
give you something, as well.

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:21.140
I thought it would make you happy.

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:23.930
I did a foolish thing.

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:25.660
Your Highness.

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:30.150
You have nothing to apologize for.

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:33.920
There isn't a servant around 
who talks back to her master.

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:36.450
Hongqiao scolded me.

00:20:36.450 --> 00:20:38.920
She said I'd forgotten my place 
as a lady-in-waiting.

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:43.990
I was so worried you'd 
throw me out eventually.

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:47.270
I'm not that kind of person.

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:49.390
This is my first time keeping 
a lady-in-waiting.

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:50.930
I merely don't know what to do.

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:55.060
You mean you'll allow me to stay?

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:57.440
Do you wish to remain here?

00:20:57.440 --> 00:21:01.730
I'd be too worried about leaving you alone.

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:03.960
You're so tense all the time.

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:06.200
You must be exhausted every day.

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:12.370
We know you dye your hair.

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:19.300
But, Hongqiao and I will never tell anyone.

00:21:19.650 --> 00:21:24.170
You can relax more when you're here.

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:28.090
Thank you.

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:32.970
Oh, right. I have something for you.

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:35.980
Are you sure?!

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:37.230
Yes.

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:38.980
I'm so happy!

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:40.600
But, what should I do?!

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:43.810
I couldn't eat something 
so special all by myself.

00:21:43.810 --> 00:21:46.240
I know. Let's eat them together!

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:53.460
<i>My fate had tainted</i>

00:21:53.460 --> 00:22:00.690
<i>The heavily falling snow black</i>

00:22:01.350 --> 00:22:07.170
<i>The sun shines in gradually</i>

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:09.590
<i>And so, she acquired more 
things she couldn't abandon.</i>

00:22:07.170 --> 00:22:14.350
<i>And freshly melts it away 
with its summer warmth</i>

00:22:14.970 --> 00:22:21.110
<i>The dream you saw in your eternal sleep</i>

00:22:21.110 --> 00:22:26.260
<i>I'll do whatever I can to make it come true</i>

00:22:26.260 --> 00:22:28.810
<i>(I want to help you, it's true)</i>

00:22:28.810 --> 00:22:34.800
<i>Because you made your wish to me</i>

00:22:34.800 --> 00:22:41.870
<i>Just like the sun shining 
through the darkness</i>

00:22:42.450 --> 00:22:47.440
<i>The bouquet of light</i>

00:22:47.440 --> 00:22:55.890
<i>That you had given me</i>

00:22:56.230 --> 00:23:04.580
<i>Still connects the seasons 
that will never meet</i>

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:08.920
<i>The proof of this pain</i>

00:23:08.920 --> 00:23:15.650
<i>Will it be able to stay the snow 
that falls in the summer?</i>

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:33.760
Mother, Ding Lan.

00:23:35.300 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>Episode 5</b>

00:23:35.300 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>Confidant</b>
